iminal bastard doesn't even have a mouth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13696-knurlurzhad","name":"Knurlurzhad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13696_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-26T13:11:17-07:00","id":1257426,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fiikragg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1257309-exercise-in-plot-ideas-describe-a-popular-movie-in-terms-of-a-exalted-campaign-idea?p=1257407#post1257407\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">oh, oh a two-fer :<br /> A Paragon of Justice in Shining Armour, replaced by something worse in everyway but now his armour is black.</div> </div> </div> </div>Spiderman 3?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-26T13:30:15-07:00","id":1257430,"title":"","content":"A young farmer receives a missive from a king rebelling against the Mask of Winter, asking for the help of a great heroine. He stumbles upon the heroine in question, an old gold faction sidereal hiding in the desert, exalts when her family is killed by the Mask's troops, and with the help of a night caste pirate and her trusty beastman sidekick, they go rescue the king, now captured by a terrible Dusk Caste clad in Soulsteel armor.<br /> <br /> Plot twist : the Dusk Caste is the young Solar's mother.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":541,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","user":"LeTipex","date":". 09-26-2018, 04:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-26T13:40:52-07:00","id":1257434,"title":"","content":"here's one<br /> <br /> Retired DB agent of the All-Seeing-Eye (Realm secret police) is trying to reconnect to his estranged daughter who with her mother and wealthy patrician step-father, but one day while she's in Nexus on a shopping trip she's kidnapped by guild slavers!<br /> <br /> Cue a madcap hunt through the realm and the east, as the DB has to infiltrate, expose and destroy the business operations of the cruel and corrupt guild factor who has his daughter up for auction.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Here's another:<br /> <br /> A young child is born with a supernatural sense of smell - but his destitute mother leaves him for dead. One abyssal exaltation later he 'grows up' and finds himself endowed with supernatural abilities to craft the captivating fragrances. Ultimatley obsessed with producing the perfect scent, he begins kidnapping and murdering women to steal their scent - spreading death and madness in his wake as he labors to finish his masterpiece: a scent so all-consuming that it will make anyone who smells it love the wearer...<br /> <br /> <br /> and a third:<br /> Young and hopeful DB arrives in the Imperial city, fresh from the House of the Bells - first of her otherwise lowly family to ever exalt and make anything of herself. She gets a job with The Guardians of the Realm, but due to her extremely low-born background she's largely ignored and initially sent to police incorrectly parked carriages and mounts. Humiliated, she takes it in stride and one day during her patrols manages to run down a thief who stole... some worthless flower bulbs. Later she meets a street-wise hustler who infuriates her endlessly, but after getting herself attached to an impossible to solve case, with her job on the line, she manages to force the hustler to help her solve the case. What ensues is a deep dive down a rabbit-hole of conspiracy, demonic poison that maddens those afflicted, and corruption at the highest tier of the imperial city's government. Will the young guardian be able to keep the peace and solve the mystery, or will she accidentally finger the wrong magistrate and plunge the city into chaos?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[