mber/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-27T02:43:56-07:00","id":1257537,"title":"","content":"ST: Okay, show me your character sheets.<br /> P1: Zenith Caste. I'm a soldier of the Shogunate who was recently woken from magical stasis. Boy scout type, very patriotic, always striving to do the right thing.<br /> P2: Well then, I have a feeling he won't be getting along much with my Twilight. I'm a scavenger lord slash arms dealer who Exalted when he rebuilt this cool ass First Age suit of armor. I'm in it for fun, fame and hookers!<br /> P3: Maybe we will get along, my character is very smart too!<br /> ST: Uh, why is it then that all he has are Infernal Monster Charms?<br /> P3: It's a concept. I told you about it.<br /> ST: Sigh, okay. P4?<br /> P4: Me, I'm a Dawn Caste. Lots of Brawl and Melee, but also tons of Athletics and Resistance. I come from this awesome city deep in the North where the locals worship me as a god.<br /> ST: What are you doing in the Scavenger Lands, then?<br /> P4: I, uh... I'm chasing my treacherous brother!<br /> ST: Okay, next?<br /> P5: I'm a Night Caste, this typical femme fatale spy/assassin. Lots of dodge and acrobatics, proficient in multiple fighting styles.<br /> ST: Okay guys, our story begins when this one-eyed general of Lookshyan intelligence gathers you all for a meeting...<br /> P5: Wait, where's Clint? Our characters have a shared backstory!<br /> ST: Clint will be late, he asked me to play his archer until he gets here. And I already have a role for him (smiles diabolically)...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-27T07:08:43-07:00","id":1257562,"title":"","content":"ST: Okay, you ready for some solo gaming?<br /> PC: Excited to start. So I'm playing a scavenger lord, right?<br /> ST: Yeah, expect a lot of combat though. There will be some puzzles, but you'll definitely be punching some legionnaires.<br /> PC: Hm. I'll still take Mental primary, though. I played a combat monster last time, so I want the fighting to be challenging this time. Also, I was dirt poor, so this time I want to have some dots in Resources.<br /> ST: Can you justify that in game?<br /> PC: Uh, hm... ah! I have it. He's a professor at a university! They have those in Creation, right?<br /> ST: Yeah, that will work. Could be they send him out on adventures to get artifacts and relics and stuff.<br /> PC: I like that, it sounds cool. Still needs some character, though. Do you mind if I take a Flaw?<br /> ST: Sure, you'll get Solar XP when I bring it up. What did you have in mind?<br /> PC: Ophidiophobia! Snakes have always creeped me out.<br /> ST: Nice. Alright, I'm thinking I'll start you off first with a simple dungeon crawl, maybe introduce your nemesis. See how you like the way your character plays.<br /> PC: Sounds good. Then what?<br /> ST: Well, I'm thinking the local government will come to you. I haven't decided if they know you're a Solar yet, but they're definitely at odds with the Realm. They've got word that a Great House is looking for some incredible artifact, something made for a god that predates the Primordials. Spooky army-crushing stuff.<br /> PC: Awesome. Just one last thing: my character has a whip. And a hand crossbow! Those are cool.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":175,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","user":"Prometheus878","date":". 10-03-2018, 10:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-27T07:27:55-07:00","id":1257565,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus878</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1257309-exercise-in-plot-ideas-describe-a-popular-movie-in-terms-of-a-exalted-campaign-idea?p=1257562#post1257562\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">ST: Okay, you ready for some solo gaming?<br /> PC: Excited to start. So I'm playing a scavenger lord, right?<br /> ST: Yeah, expect a lot of combat though. They'll be some puzzles, but you'll definitely be punching some legionnaires.<br /> PC: Hm. I'll still take Mental primary, though. I played a combat monster last time, so I want the fighting to be challenging this time. Also, I was dirt poor, so this time I want to have some dots in Resources.<br /> ST: Can you justify that in game?<br /> PC: Uh, hm... ah! I have it. He's a professor at a university! They have those in Creation, right?<br /> ST: Yeah, that will work. Could be they send him out on adventures to get artifacts and relics and stuff.<br /> PC: I like that, it sounds cool. Still needs some character, though. Do you mind if I take a Flaw?<br /> ST: Sure, you'll get Solar XP when I bring it up. What did you have in mind?<br /> PC: Ophidiophobia! Snakes have always creeped me out.<br /> ST: Nice. Alright, I'm thinking I'll start you off first with a simple dungeon crawl, maybe introduce your nemesis. See how you like the way your character plays.<br /> PC: Sounds good. Then what?<br /> ST: Well, I'm thinking the local government will come to you. I haven't decided if they know you're a Solar yet, but they're definitely at odds with the Realm. They've got word that a Great House is looking for some incredible artifact, something made for a god that predates the Primordials. Spooky army-crushing stuff.<br /> PC: Awesome. Just one last thing: my character has a whip. And a hand crossbow! Those are cool.</div> </div> </div> </div>I feel like some arks are gonna get raided in this game <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-27T07:46:18-07:00","id":1257569,"title":"","content":"[Redacted]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 09-27-2018, 10:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-27T09:08:49-07:00","id":1257580,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1257309-exercise-in-plot-ideas-describe-a-popular-movie-in-terms-of-a-exalted-campaign-idea?p=1257426#post1257426\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Spiderman 3?</div> </div> </div> </div>nope but fits my vagueness. it was 2 films with the same name. Think Alchemicals<br /> <br /> A restored/rebuilt Paragon of Justice in Shining Armour, replaced by something worse in everyway but now his armour is black and stuggles with a lose of humanity, but 'love is the answer'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11701-fiikragg","name":"Fiikragg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11701_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-27T09:36:49-07:00","id":1257584,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fiikragg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1257309-exercise-in-plot-ideas-describe-a-popular-movie-in-terms-of-a-exalted-campaign-idea?p=1257580#post1257580\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> nope but fits my vagueness. it was 2 films with the same name. Think Alchemicals<br /> <br /> A restored/rebuilt Paragon of Justice in Shining Armour, replaced by something worse in everyway but now his armour is black and stuggles with a lose of humanity, but 'love is the answer'</div> </div> </div> </div>That's the new Robocop movie!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-27T09:55:34-07:00","id":1257587,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LeTipex</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1257309-exercise-in-plot-ideas-describe-a-popular-movie-in-terms-of-a-exalted-campaign-idea?p=1257430#post1257430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A young farmer receives a missive from a king rebelling against the Mask of Winter, asking for the help of a great heroine. He stumbles upon the heroine in question, an old gold faction sidereal hiding in the desert, exalts when her family is killed by the Mask's troops, and with the help of a night caste pirate and her trusty beastman sidekick, they go rescue the king, now captured by a terrible Dusk Caste clad in Soulsteel armor.<br /> <br /> Plot twist : the Dusk Caste is the young Solar's mother.</div> </div> </div> </div>...the Force is strong with this one.<br /> <br /> The PCs: An Eclipse from the Realm currently running a teahouse in Thorns, an Abyssal Day caste serving the Mask of Winters as an enforcer, the Eclipse's Lunar Mate (a resident of Thorns who Exalted rescuing some of her loved ones during the invasion), and her lover- a Dragonblooded who survived the occupation, and has figured out the Mask's secret weakness and is trying to get safely back to House Cathak with it.<br /> <br /> The Plot: the Lunar and Dragonblood are trying to smuggle the secret weakness MacGuffin out of town to get it to the Realm. Eclipse is trying to gather intel on the Deathlord for the Gold faction. Abyssal is secretly looking for a way out from under the Mask of Winter's thumb. Nobody knows that anyone else is Exalted or anybody else's motivations at the start of game-the ST has lied to each of them and told them they are the secret exception being allowed in a &quot;we all start as mortals&quot; game. Shenanigans ensue.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-27T12:20:03-07:00","id":1257624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1257309-exercise-in-plot-ideas-describe-a-popular-movie-in-terms-of-a-exalted-campaign-idea?p=1257530#post1257530\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for the guessing game part of this:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Hardcore Henry.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ding ding ding! We have a winner!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13696-knurlurzhad","name":"Knurlurzhad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13696_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-27T16:50:42-07:00","id":1257681,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>webkilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1257309-exercise-in-plot-ideas-describe-a-popular-movie-in-terms-of-a-exalted-campaign-idea?p=1257434#post1257434\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> and a third:<br /> Young and hopeful DB arrives in the Imperial city, fresh from the House of the Bells - first of her otherwise lowly family to ever exalt and make anything of herself. She gets a job with The Guardians of the Realm, but due to her extremely low-born background she's largely ignored and initially sent to police incorrectly parked carriages and mounts. Humiliated, she takes it in stride and one day during her patrols manages to run down a thief who stole... some worthless flower bulbs. Later she meets a street-wise hustler who infuriates her endlessly, but after getting herself attached to an impossible to solve case, with her job on the line, she manages to force the hustler to help her solve the case. What ensues is a deep dive down a rabbit-hole of conspiracy, demonic poison that maddens those afflicted, and corruption at the highest tier of the imperial city's government. Will the young guardian be able to keep the peace and solve the mystery, or will she accidentally finger the wrong magistrate and plunge the city into chaos?</div> </div> </div> </div>Zootopia, methinks.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12111-the_larz","name":"the_larz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-27T18:16:17-07:00","id":1257699,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Morangias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1257309-exercise-in-plot-ideas-describe-a-popular-movie-in-terms-of-a-exalted-campaign-idea?p=1257537#post1257537\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">ST: Okay, show me your character sheets.<br /> P1: Zenith Caste. I'm a soldier of the Shogunate who was recently woken from magical stasis. Boy scout type, very patriotic, always striving to do the right thing.<br /> P2: Well then, I have a feeling he won't be getting along much with my Twilight. I'm a scavenger lord slash arms dealer who Exalted when he rebuilt this cool ass First Age suit of armor. I'm in it for fun, fame and hookers!<br /> P3: Maybe we will get along, my character is very smart too!<br /> ST: Uh, why is it then that all he has are Infernal Monster Charms?<br /> P3: It's a concept. I told you about it.<br /> ST: Sigh, okay. P4?<br /> P4: Me, I'm a Dawn Caste. Lots of Brawl and Melee, but also tons of Athletics and Resistance. I come from this awesome city deep in the North where the locals worship me as a god.<br /> ST: What are you doing in the Scavenger Lands, then?<br /> P4: I, uh... I'm chasing my treacherous brother!<br /> ST: Okay, next?<br /> P5: I'm a Night Caste, this typical femme fatale spy/assassin. Lots of dodge and acrobatics, proficient in multiple fighting styles.<br /> ST: Okay guys, our story begins when this one-eyed general of Lookshyan intelligence gathers you all for a meeting...<br /> P5: Wait, where's Clint? Our characters have a shared backstory!<br /> ST: Clint will be late, he asked me to play his archer until he gets here. And I already have a role for him (smiles diabolically)...</div> </div> </div> </div>And everyone got their own backstory session but the Night Caste, who just guest starred in a second session for the Twilight. Such slights will be Avenged! \ud83d\ude1c<br /> <br /> My entry: Three different Solars have been invited to an island in the Southwest inner sea, only to discover their host is a unique being from the First Age and needs them to work out which one of them created her. The real problem lies in that all three of them worked on similar projects in their last Incarnations with a powerful Lunar master of Silver-Voiced Nightingale Style.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24220-cryo-seraph","name":"Cryo-Seraph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-27T21:01:30-07:00","id":1257712,"title":"","content":"The ST is looking over the player's characters:<br /> <br /> &quot;Ok, let's see. Tim, you're the Zenith, huh? Good amount of Presence, Performance, and Lore here. Intelligence 5 and Perception 4, okay. That flaw should be fun when you get near a tavern, heh heh.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Chris, you're the Dawn? Wow, Wits 4, Intelligence 3 - kinda playing against type, but I can see it. Brawl 5, very nice, Lore 3 with a military background, okay. You've got a bunch of Archery, I see, but a Major Principle of &quot;I hate ranged weapons&quot;? Okay, interesting character trait.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Al is playing Twilight, I see. Intelligence and Wits at max, and Lore and Linguistics as well, I see. Craft decent too. I like that Major Principle of &quot;I'm the best!&quot;, lots of potential there.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Beth, Night Caste. All the Dexterity, Wits, and good Intelligence. And I see you've maxed out Larceny, Stealth, and Athletics. And that intimacy towards &quot;danger&quot; should be fun.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;And, last but not least, Gina's Eclipse. Maxed Manipulation, makes sense. Larceny high, interesting choice, and Presence. <i>No</i> dots in Performance? Okay, it's a character thing, I get that.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;So, <i>all</i> of you have Resources 5? You're basically not interested in money at all, huh, you've got it all already? Well, based on your shared intimacies and talents, I think I can definitely work something up for all of you to do together...&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-27T23:53:10-07:00","id":1257722,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cryo-Seraph</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1257309-exercise-in-plot-ideas-describe-a-popular-movie-in-terms-of-a-exalted-campaign-idea?p=1257699#post1257699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And everyone got their own backstory session but the Night Caste, who just guest starred in a second session for the Twilight. Such slights will be Avenged! \ud83d\ude1c<br /> <br /> My entry: Three different Solars have been invited to an island in the Southwest inner sea, only to discover their host is a unique being from the First Age and needs them to work out which one of them created her. The real problem lies in that all three of them worked on similar projects in their last Incarnations with a powerful Lunar master of Silver-Voiced Nightingale Style.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, mama mia, this one is sweet.<br /> <br /> Here's another: a rogue agent of the All-Seeing Eye, who turned into an mad Akuma prophet since leaving the organisation, is captured. He is being escorted back to the Realm for interogation when the player characters discover that his followers have found vials of the original Contagion, and plan on freeing him during the transport to the Blessed Isle. <br /> <br /> As agents of the Eye, the players must try to keep him into custody and find the vials before they are used to pollute the source of the great Eastern rivers. But in a climate of approaching civil war, even other Realm agents are suspect (and some of them might even have been corrupted by the Akuma in secret, serving his mad plans!)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":541,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","user":"LeTipex","date":". 09-28-2018, 03:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"t