erested in money at all, huh, you've got it all already? Well, based on your shared intimacies and talents, I think I can definitely work something up for all of you to do together...&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I dunno if 'Leverage' counts as a movie, but I'd give it a pass in this case :-P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my homebrew exalt: The Fabulists - Chosen of the Raksha <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141861-peach-new-exalt-splat-the-fabulist-exalts-chosen-of-the-raksha\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","name":"armyofwhispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"790"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-28T09:48:08-07:00","id":1257791,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LeTipex</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1257309-exercise-in-plot-ideas-describe-a-popular-movie-in-terms-of-a-exalted-campaign-idea?p=1257722#post1257722\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh, mama mia, this one is sweet.<br /> <br /> Here's another: a rogue agent of the All-Seeing Eye, who turned into an mad Akuma prophet since leaving the organisation, is captured. He is being escorted back to the Realm for interogation when the player characters discover that his followers have found vials of the original Contagion, and plan on freeing him during the transport to the Blessed Isle.<br /> <br /> As agents of the Eye, the players must try to keep him into custody and find the vials before they are used to pollute the source of the great Eastern rivers. But in a climate of approaching civil war, even other Realm agents are suspect (and some of them might even have been corrupted by the Akuma in secret, serving his mad plans!)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Man, the fallout of this one sounds like a pretty impossible mission...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>DrLoveMonkey - &quot;On the other hand having a warhammer that's basically a steel beer keg on the end of a seven foot pole is fucking awesome.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9453-octopoid","name":"Octopoid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9453_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"424"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-28T16:40:40-07:00","id":1257860,"title":"","content":"The Wyld Hunt has been pursuing the Solar Exalt <i>Speaker of Kings</i> for years now, but he's always a step ahead of them. During his last raid on an imperial supply dock, they almost got him, but he slipped away, and all they captured was one of the mortals he'd tricked into helping him. The campaign is played out in flashbacks as the Dragon-Blooded investigator interrogates and pressures the poor mortal, finally making him break down, realize he was working with an Anathema, and name one of his companions as Speaker of Kings. As the broken-down mortal leaves, the Dragon-Blooded, satisfied, sits back, only to realize a moment too late that the &quot;mortal&quot; made the entire story up as he went along and was almost certainly Speaker of Kings himself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-28T17:02:26-07:00","id":1257866,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aquillion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1257309-exercise-in-plot-ideas-describe-a-popular-movie-in-terms-of-a-exalted-campaign-idea?p=1257860#post1257860\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Wyld Hunt has been pursuing the Solar Exalt <i>Speaker of Kings</i> for years now, but he's always a step ahead of them. During his last raid on an imperial supply dock, they almost got him, but he slipped away, and all they captured was one of the mortals he'd tricked into helping him. The campaign is played out in flashbacks as the Dragon-Blooded investigator interrogates and pressures the poor mortal, finally making him break down, realize he was working with an Anathema, and name one of his companions as Speaker of Kings. As the broken-down mortal leaves, the Dragon-Blooded, satisfied, sits back, only to realize a moment too late that the &amp;quot;mortal&amp;quot; made the entire story up as he went along and was almost certainly Speaker of Kings himself.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wow, sounds like an unusual group of suspected criminals. <br /> <br /> A Sidereal of Endings falls in love with a preistess of local weaver god, and undergoes a quest to change the loom of fate to prevent tragedy at her village.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-29T10:01:25-07:00","id":1257984,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>armyofwhispers</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1257309-exercise-in-plot-ideas-describe-a-popular-movie-in-terms-of-a-exalted-campaign-idea?p=1257380#post1257380\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">all the PCs are warstrider pilots. A nearby portal spits out a steady stream of ever-larger behemoths that you must fight to the death to protect everyone around you.</div> </div> </div> </div>Pacific Rim.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11847-kfinigan","name":"KFinigan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-29T10:04:54-07:00","id":1257985,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LeTipex</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1257309-exercise-in-plot-ideas-describe-a-popular-movie-in-terms-of-a-exalted-campaign-idea?p=1257430#post1257430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A young farmer receives a missive from a king rebelling against the Mask of Winter, asking for the help of a great heroine. He stumbles upon the heroine in question, an old gold faction sidereal hiding in the desert, exalts when her family is killed by the Mask's troops, and with the help of a night caste pirate and her trusty beastman sidekick, they go rescue the king, now captured by a terrible Dusk Caste clad in Soulsteel armor.<br /> <br /> Plot twist : the Dusk Caste is the young Solar's mother.</div> </div> </div> </div>Star Wars: A New Hope?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11847-kfinigan","name":"KFinigan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-29T10:09:30-07:00","id":1257986,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Morangias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1257309-exercise-in-plot-ideas-describe-a-popular-movie-in-terms-of-a-exalted-campaign-idea?p=1257537#post1257537\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">ST: Okay, show me your character sheets.<br /> P1: Zenith Caste. I'm a soldier of the Shogunate who was recently woken from magical stasis. Boy scout type, very patriotic, always striving to do the right thing.<br /> P2: Well then, I have a feeling he won't be getting along much with my Twilight. I'm a scavenger lord slash arms dealer who Exalted when he rebuilt this cool ass First Age suit of armor. I'm in it for fun, fame and hookers!<br /> P3: Maybe we will get along, my character is very smart too!<br /> ST: Uh, why is it then that all he has are Infernal Monster Charms?<br /> P3: It's a concept. I told you about it.<br /> ST: Sigh, okay. P4?<br /> P4: Me, I'm a Dawn Caste. Lots of Brawl and Melee, but also tons of Athletics and Resistance. I come from this awesome city deep in the North where the locals worship me as a god.<br /> ST: What are you doing in the Scavenger Lands, then?<br /> P4: I, uh... I'm chasing my treacherous brother!<br /> ST: Okay, next?<br /> P5: I'm a Night Caste, this typical femme fatale spy/assassin. Lots of dodge and acrobatics, proficient in multiple fighting styles.<br /> ST: Okay guys, our story begins when this one-eyed general of Lookshyan intelligence gathers you all for a meeting...<br /> P5: Wait, where's Clint? Our characters have a shared backstory!<br /> ST: Clint will be late, he asked me to play his archer until he gets here. And I already have a role for him (smiles diabolically)...</div> </div> </div> </div>Well played. <br /> <br /> What are the intros for the next two sequels?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11847-kfinigan","name":"KFinigan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-29T10:15:46-07:00","id":1257987,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>armyofwhispers</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1257309-exercise-in-plot-ideas-describe-a-popular-movie-in-terms-of-a-exalted-campaign-idea?p=1257766#post1257766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I dunno if 'Leverage' counts as a movie, but I'd give it a pass in this case :-P</div> </div> </div> </div>The names give it away once you know......","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11847-kfinigan","name":"KFinigan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-29T10:17:16-07:00","id":1257989,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aquillion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1257309-exercise-in-plot-ideas-describe-a-popular-movie-in-terms-of-a-exalted-campaign-idea?p=1257860#post1257860\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Wyld Hunt has been pursuing the Solar Exalt <i>Speaker of Kings</i> for years now, but he's always a step ahead of them. During his last raid on an imperial supply dock, they almost got him, but he slipped away, and all they captured was one of the mortals he'd tricked into helping him. The campaign is played out in flashbacks as the Dragon-Blooded investigator interrogates and pressures the poor mortal, finally making him break down, realize he was working with an Anathema, and name one of his companions as Speaker of Kings. As the broken-down mortal leaves, the Dragon-Blooded, satisfied, sits back, only to realize a moment too late that the &amp;quot;mortal&amp;quot; made the entire story up as he went along and was almost certainly Speaker of Kings himself.</div> </div> </div> </div>I dig revenge flicks full of the usual suspects.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11847-kfinigan","name":"KFinigan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-03T15:56:34-07:00","id":1258780,"title":"","content":"Ok, just really botched a socialize role at a major event. Now everyone is against me. So, I flee into the mountains, and use scoery and elemental charms to construct my own sanctuary Manse/palace. Now no one can bother me or be hurt<br /> <br /> But looks like the nobles are forming a Wyld hunt now","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-03T16:15:55-07:00","id":1258784,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1257309-exercise-in-plot-ideas-describe-a-popular-movie-in-terms-of-a-exalted-campaign-idea?p=1258780#post1258780\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok, just really botched a socialize role at a major event. Now everyone is against me. So, I flee into the mountains, and use scoery and elemental charms to construct my own sanctuary Manse/palace. Now no one can bother me or be hurt<br /> <br /> But looks like the nobles are forming a Wyld hunt now</div> </div> </div> </div>Watchmen. <br /> <br /> Since no one guessed mine it was <i>Your Name</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-03T16:27:22-07:00","id":1258785,"title":"","content":"^nope.<br /> <br /> 10 character limit prana","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"h